message: "If you use the ShrinkRadar case library, please cite it as below and link https://shrinkradar.com/data/."
type: dataset
title: "ShrinkRadar documented shrinkflation cases"
abstract: "Documented shrinkflation cases (before/after package sizes, dates, countries, shelf prices where recorded) with a link to the consumer-agency, consumer-advocate or news source that reported each one. Rebuilt whenever the library changes."
authors:
